The plate looks like a square dinner or side plate, roughly 22-24 cm across. It holds about 9 roasted red potato wedges or chunks. Each chunk is about 4-5 cm long and 2-3 cm thick, which comes to roughly 15-20 g apiece. That gives about 150 g in total.

The surface has a light sheen of oil and some rosemary. I'm counting those as part of the potatoes rather than as separate items.

